<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
    <title>Przerwa techniczna – Warsztatownia Sensoryczna</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
    {# Fonts are cosmetic: when Google Fonts is unreachable the system stack below takes over. #}
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --beige: #f9f1de;
            --brown: #583818;
            --red: #e85030;
            --yellow: #f8c028;
            --blue: #80b8d0;
            --green: #b0a838;
            --pink: #e8c0d8;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px 16px;
            font-family: Quicksand, ui-rounded, "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            color: var(--brown);
            background-color: var(--beige);
            background-image:
                radial-gradient(at 12% 8%, hsl(318 53% 86% / 0.42) 0, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(at 88% 12%, hsl(197 56% 65% / 0.32) 0, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(at 78% 88%, hsl(84 54% 60% / 0.25) 0, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(at 18% 82%, hsl(43 90% 65% / 0.34) 0, transparent 40%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            background-size: 160% 160%;
            animation: drift 22s ease-in-out infinite;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        main {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 560px;
            text-align: center;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px 28px 36px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08);
        }

        .logo {
            display: block;
            width: min(100%, 360px);
            height: auto;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
        }

        .dots {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .dots span {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: bounce 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .dots span:nth-child(1) { background: var(--red); }
        .dots span:nth-child(2) { background: var(--yellow); animation-delay: 0.15s; }
        .dots span:nth-child(3) { background: var(--blue); animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .dots span:nth-child(4) { background: var(--green); animation-delay: 0.45s; }
        .dots span:nth-child(5) { background: var(--pink); animation-delay: 0.6s; }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 2rem);
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: var(--red);
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .eta {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 8px 0 4px;
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgb(248 192 40 / 0.3);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .note {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            40% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }

        @keyframes drift {
            0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%, 100% 50%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%, 0% 50%, 0% 0%, 100% 0%; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            body, .dots span { animation: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <img class="logo" src="/logo.webp" alt="Warsztatownia Sensoryczna" width="1380" height="400">
    <div class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <h1>Przerwa techniczna</h1>
    <p>Pracujemy nad ulepszeniem naszego serwisu, dlatego chwilowo nie można z niego korzystać.</p>
{% if maintenance_eta | default('') | length > 0 %}
    <p class="eta">Wracamy: {{ maintenance_eta }}</p>
{% endif %}
    <p class="note">Twoje rezerwacje i płatności są bezpieczne. Zapraszamy za chwilę!</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
